    "steam_appid": 1769140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/8727667c1e4541d3c977fcd034110c9f.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join MIRAI #167 and Jonas, two characters separated by time but united in soul\u2014switch between them to use each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b934a6c573a45c4e3bafdb92287e73fa.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat and pass through enemies in a variety of ways: engage in melee combat, deflect gunfire back at them, throw objects from the environment, or rely on classic runner moves like jumping, sliding, and dashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/d3ef5bd84a647f9dc78096be845bda68.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One hit and you're out? No problem. Simply rewind time as you wish, correct your mistakes, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/65c906c21d87c6477255da77d2b3f496.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful new abilities and enhance your characters' skills through a dynamic progression system tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/72308655a122aa157c61ba2de3552adb.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious story unfolds through cinematic moments seamlessly integrated into gameplay, leading to a surprising and unpredictable conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a future where intelligent robots have taken control, Jonas, a remorseful programmer, must confront the machines he helped create as they threaten humanity. MIRAI #167, a powerful time-traveling robot that Jonas himself designed, is sent from the future to stop him and alter the course of history.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/8727667c1e4541d3c977fcd034110c9f.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/281405a8b7971e47c1f286a759668731.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join MIRAI #167 and Jonas, two characters separated by time but united in soul\u2014switch between them to use each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b934a6c573a45c4e3bafdb92287e73fa.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/a709c136a459f07ae17ffa2916799eab.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat and pass through enemies in a variety of ways: engage in melee combat, deflect gunfire back at them, throw objects from the environment, or rely on classic runner moves like jumping, sliding, and dashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/d3ef5bd84a647f9dc78096be845bda68.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/c33b955d0078daa54e5bcd3d3a966051.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One hit and you're out? No problem. Simply rewind time as you wish, correct your mistakes, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/65c906c21d87c6477255da77d2b3f496.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/4e1d3fb97cc5b7a565912c244a2c2bd5.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful new abilities and enhance your characters' skills through a dynamic progression system tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/72308655a122aa157c61ba2de3552adb.avif?t=1754589031\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.poster.avif?t=1754589031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.webm?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769140/extras/b507c25da0a6a708e1f3d325841afd63.mp4?t=1754589031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious story unfolds through cinematic moments seamlessly integrated into gameplay, leading to a surprising and unpredictable conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a future where intelligent robots have taken control, Jonas, a remorseful programmer, must confront the machines he helped create as they threaten humanity. MIRAI #167, a powerful time-traveling robot that Jonas himself designed, is sent from the future to stop him and alter the course of history.</p>",
    "short_description": "MIRAI #167 is a 2D pixel-art runner where you control two characters at once, rewinding time and jumping through portals. Embark on a frantic adventure to save humanity in a world where AI surpasses human control - upgrade your characters, break records and rewrite history before it\u2019s too late!",
